[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=J.A.R.V.I.S. Fly Vault
Comment=Open Fly Vault (five caged fruit flies, each run by its own tiny brain sim, under a simulated-time clock) in the browser
Exec=xdg-open https://jarvis-fly.sites.tab.bot/
Icon=jarvis-fly-web
Categories=Game;
Keywords=jarvis;fly;vault;flies;brain;simulation;vr;quest;
StartupNotify=false
# JARVIS OS 1.0.0-rc7: a launcher for one of JARVIS's web apps (they also work on a PC with mouse and keyboard)
